window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The Joker meets Haunting Adeline in this dark, forbidden romance where a prison nurse is caught in a dangerous web of obsession with her ruthless psychopath patient.</p> <p>My life has been a series of bad decisions. Marrying an abusive man was the first... but falling for a dangerous inmate where I’m a nurse may be the worst.</p> <p>He’s brutal, heartless, and twisted. But he’s also the only one to notice the bruises on my skin. His forbidden touch becomes my addiction. His drugging kisses my obsession.</p> <p>After I learn the truth about why he’s in prison, I try to escape, but he finds me. Now I'm his prisoner.</p> <p><i>Toxic</i> is a standalone dark romance featuring a pierced, morally gray antihero with Joker energy, obsessive “Touch Her &amp; Die” protectiveness, and a dangerous cat-and-mouse dynamic with the prison nurse he refuses to let go. It contains explicit sexual content and a full list of trigger warnings can be found at the beginning of the book.</p>"; 
